{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seed Hunter is an action-packed Roguelite game. We strive to incorporate handcrafted animations, traditional Chinese gameplay design, and a variety of items and weapon choices.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/125cb5b19360ee5091655b7a32082600.poster.avif?t=1763376128\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/125cb5b19360ee5091655b7a32082600.webm?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/125cb5b19360ee5091655b7a32082600.mp4?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7 Types and 37 Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axe, Sword &amp; Shield, Dual Blades, Great Sword, Sword, Kunai, and Bow. We offer 37 different weapons across 7 categories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/4ce4cd0a3a3ed5b0640d2b33413ca2b2.poster.avif?t=1763376128\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/4ce4cd0a3a3ed5b0640d2b33413ca2b2.webm?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/4ce4cd0a3a3ed5b0640d2b33413ca2b2.mp4?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each weapon, you will have different skills. If you like it, why not make it stronger and play with it the way you enjoy?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of Ability Cards, 8 Upgrade Paths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have designed two different skill trees. You can add some skills from your base, which will make you stronger in your next adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For your adventure, we have created more than 100 different skill cards that provide you with unlimited play styles, making you the strongest hunter we have ever seen.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/4d793469fdb4eb83fd19ac5acc8361f3.poster.avif?t=1763376128\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/4d793469fdb4eb83fd19ac5acc8361f3.webm?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/4d793469fdb4eb83fd19ac5acc8361f3.mp4?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handcraft Animation in Seed Hunter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like our favorite game, Cuphead, we use handcrafted animation in Seed Hunter. We create every jump and slash ourselves from scratch. We hope it provides you with a splendid gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/160cd58a2cab72ed4972a7c1daa064f0.poster.avif?t=1763376128\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/160cd58a2cab72ed4972a7c1daa064f0.webm?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078490/extras/160cd58a2cab72ed4972a7c1daa064f0.mp4?t=1763376128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"22a68e02736a96a9c7568763950e22d602503dad.jpg","localized_name":"Hello Hunter","name":"Hello Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078490/22a68e02736a96a9c7568763950e22d602503dad.jpg"},{"icon":"bf4a527845699b01030142129ec9381d9524c817.jpg","localized_name":"Whole New Start","name":"Whole New Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078490/bf4a527845699b01030142129ec9381d9524c817.jpg"},{"icon":"c0c2989a4615037a9785b8b91ac6375f38d1e05c.jpg","localized_name":"Indomitable","name":"Indomitable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078490/c0c2989a4615037a9785b8b91ac6375f38d1e05c.jpg"},{"icon":"a2f30ecfd386122c661d6015cd72601c866a1f62.jpg","localized_name":"Missing Hunter","name":"Missing Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078490/a2f30ecfd386122c661d6015cd72601c866a1f62.jpg"},{"icon":"f18dba20e9166c6499adae089f5bf91ac8bab41c.jpg","localized_name":"The Slave Redemption","name":"The Slave Redemption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078490/f18dba20e9166c6499adae089f5bf91ac8bab41c.jpg"},{"icon":"7fe466bb7d26a6cd9618bce2ba8359e9e82a3a80.jpg","localized_name":"Wisdom of the Craftsman","name":"Wisdom of the Craftsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078490/7fe466bb7d26a6cd9618bce2ba8359e9e82a3a80.jpg"},{"icon":"ab1450355e36922bb93127f2decb3bd1a8b8f992.jpg","localized_name":"Peaceful Machine","name":"Peaceful Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078490/ab1450355e36922bb93127f2decb3bd1a8b8f992.jpg"},{"icon":"b6f56242ff97562b1d7320d17133ee4383f8cd63.jpg","localized_name":"The Lonewolf Valemist","name":"The Lonewolf Valemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea